important:
  - id: i1
    task: "Task 8: input/rich.lua — full prepare() pipeline"
    step: "Step 3 — make_scheduler shared between outer large-file tasks and inner per-chunk tasks"
    concern: "Same scheduler instance used for both outer file-level and inner per-chunk sched.run calls. With low concurrency (e.g. 1), outer tasks occupy all slots and inner chunk tasks queue forever — deadlock. Integration tests use concurrency=4, masking this."
    recommendation: "Use a separate inner scheduler (or run chunks sequentially / uncapped) for per-chunk calls within a single large-file task. Reserve the outer scheduler for file-level granularity."

